  "job_B16.2.3_20251003_114353": {
    "text": "Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t leofeno\u00f0 \u00e6gelno\u00f0es sunu \u00e6t korstune h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hine & his\nCrist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre awende.\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00c6gelsige \u00e6t Linncume h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht Wilsige his sunu ut \u00e6t\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6gelsige byttices sunu h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hildesige his sunu ut \u00e6t\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t godwig se bucca h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht leofgife \u00fea d\u00e6gean \u00e6t nor\u00f0stoke &\nCrist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre awende.\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lsige abbot h\u00e6f\u00f0 gefreod godwine bace \u00e6t stantune for hine &\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00f0issere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lfwig se red h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hine sylfne ut \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige abbod &\n\u00dear is to gewitnes eall se hired on ba\u00f0an.\nCrist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende.\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t edric \u00e6t fordan h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht s\u00e6gyfu his dohtor \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisses cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lfric scot & \u00e6gelric scot synd gefreod for \u00e6lsiges abbodes\n\u00deis is gedon on ealles hiredes gewitness.\nHer swutala\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t siwine leofwies sunu \u00e6t lincumbe hafu\u00fe geboht sydefl\u00e6de ut\nAnd herto is gewittnesse Godric ladda, & s\u00e6wold & his twegen sunan, scirewold & brihtwold.\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t iohann h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht gunnilde \u00feurkilles dohter \u00e6t gode\nCrist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende, & he h\u00e6f\u00f0 hi bet\u00e6ht criste & sancte petre for his moder\nHer swutela\u00fe on \u00f0yssere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t s\u00e6wi hagg \u00e6t widecume h\u00e6f\u00fe gedon ut his twegen sunu \u00e6tt\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t lifgi\u00f0 \u00e6t forda is gefreod & hire twa cild for \u00feone biscop iohann\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6gylm\u00e6r bohte s\u00e6\u00fery\u00fee \u00e6t s\u00e6wolde abbude mid III manxan,\nCrist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende.\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t wulwine hareberd bohte \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige abbude \u00e6lfgy\u00fee mid\n& crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende.\nHer swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6gylsige bohte wynric \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige abbude mid anon yre golde.\n\u00deysses ys to gewitnysse \u00e6lfryd portgereua & eal se hired on ba\u00feon.\nCrist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende.",
